---
title: Citron Chaud
source: https://cupofjo.com/2026/01/28/citron-chaud/
servings: 2
---

Add @freshly squeezed lemon juice (4-5 lemons, depending on size){1%cup} to a #saucepan{}, and set over a high heat until it just begins to simmer.

Remove from the burner and pour into mugs.

Add @very hot water{1/4%cup}, and stir in @honey{1%tsp} until it dissolves.

Optional: add the other @very hot water{1/4%cup} and second @honey{1%tsp} if desired.
